      <Markdown><![CDATA[
### Bridging the simplicity gap

The `<EChart>` component exposes the full ECharts API, which is powerful but verbose. XMLUI's component system bridges the gap. Here are three XMLUI-level components — `SimpleBarChart`, `SimpleLineChart`, and `SimplePieChart` — that wrap `<EChart>` with a simple `data`/`xKey`/`yKeys` API, similar to the core Recharts wrappers but backed by ECharts:
]]></Markdown>

