Each component is a single `.xmlui` file in the `components/` folder. They map simple props (`data`, `xKey`, `yKeys`) to an ECharts option object. When you outgrow them, drop down to `<EChart option="{...}" />` directly — the full API is always available.
]]></Markdown>

